  // CLOSED_INCOMPLETE below (owner decision, before this
  // migration ever reached a live environment. Retained only because Postgres cannot drop an
  // enum value; deliberately and permanently dead, unlike the pre-ticket A-46 finding this
  // ticket otherwise closes.
